{
  "id": "JOS.1",
  "number": "1",
  "bookId": "JOS",
  "reference": "Yoshuwa 1",
  "verseCount": 18,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JOS 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ASEETA gwarukusa Yoshuwa gideaba ang'waanya ng'eanyiida Ganaani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iing'ata miyeeda Musa was siida gadiyeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, hean gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA Yoshuwa was orjeeda Nuni, nea niny ea siida gadiyeeda Musa gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Musaheeda was Siideanyu bea gadiyeeda nimi; asi adiing'diing'da, aghaawana Yordanean, ang'iing'i ea fiisu, aweayeena ng'eanyiida jea daadaw saawa was fuga Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heechea ealaabwa sean aba geeshangeagwa neagoonyeegwa, gawuurji gidaghayi eaheeleesiindi sea Musa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'eada dareapcheeda ea ghoah Lebanoni ea ghwahita eendida hawiin, ea eenda Furati, ea ng'eanyiisean bea fuga Hiti ea ghwahita basooda haw biyeara abeeda gayghoah moonghoodeang'wa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manda siida jea gawa ghamiinaada aba madeadaang'u aba jeeda eawoojigaagu sean bea giibindaang'u; gawuurji gidaghayi eandeayeati Musa, asi ea gichea eendeayeeta sea ang'iing'i gil; maydaashoanyaneey nea maydanung'useey heeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daruusiida nea gimwaanyiidi muuchi; aba gideaba gaynung' gwahearan fiisu ng'eanyiida ghayi eayeaksi ghweaniga nyaawa habeawooda gideaba gaydaadaw saawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daruusiida galeagasean nea guwoosi mwaay muuchi, sina nea gisikteawi muuchi ghabeada deaweedeeda sean ghayi rukuneey Musa was siideanyu bea gadiyeeda; adinung'waadi yamoodeaba geaw bea geatinda dugwa ghana geatinda ghaadaam, ak gay nyasa gheamamda miy aba heechea una sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gitaaboani bea deaweedean adagwaheeli ghuutaang'u galeagasean, nea giiteemsheesi askweari ea eawa, nea gisikteawi muuchi ng'asheega sean sing'oorsa jeeda; aba gideaba nih gichea ghwanung' nyagaada gil aba naweadaang'u, nea ginyasi gheamamda miy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neada ea mii aniini? Dea rukuneey gideaba daruusiida nea gibeahi meaynata miy; adibeali nea adihirbabani aba gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U gaymideawana heechea una sean.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yoshuwa gwarukusa buuneeda gideaba ootiing'diing'da geat",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwarukusa Yoshuwa fuga hees bea buuneeda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ang'ata asiga ghuuta museasooda ak goorukusi buuneeda, gideaba, ‘Ootiing'diing'da geat; aba gideaba iing'ata eawooji samwagu gajeakghaawana eeni bea Yordaniin, ak gooweayi jeeda oombala ng'eanyiida gooneegwa NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA ak goombali.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha Yoshuwa eemeeda Rubeni ea Gadi, ea eemeeda silach bugusta bea Manase, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Oapkaada ng'asheanda ghayi rukuneegwa Musaheeda was siida gadiyeeda NG'UTAMIIDA nea gwayi, ‘NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U gaygagooneegwa heechea afuufana, ak gaygagooneegwa ng'eanyiini.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gadeemgeagwa, ea diibigeagwa, ea dugweagwa gaygoobiida ng'eanyiida gooneegwa Musa was gayeewda Yordani, nea headiga sean mideawa dabita ng'ucheeda mida bugusteang'wa gayghang'ata gaweay madeeda buweadeegeagwa ak ghaweat saawa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea ghoadaw NG'UTAMIIDA buweadeegeagwa fuufta gawuurji gidaghayi goondaneegwa ak geembal ng'eanyiida ghayi adaw NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA saawa; ng'ata gajabiiksiina ng'eanyiida ghayi iteang'wa oombali, ak gajoombala was ng'eanyiida guh Musaheeda was siida gadiyeeda bea NG'UTAMIIDA was giigheawda Yordani bea heeda biyeara.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geasha ghuuta Yoshuwa nea geeyeesha, “Gajeesina ng'asheesu sean irukuneasean, eara heechea ajeaktaneasa sean gajeeweaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawuurji gidaghayi siileeysiindi iit Musa aba haleanjeeda sean, asi gajeeleeyseey iit; gagasa mideawana NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, gawuurji gidaghayi indeayeati Musa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida wassean jea ghaheawa diigheandaang'u, nea mooleeysiiniit ng'asheagaagu sean irukusi niny, abeeda gajeenuus. Daruusiida nea gimwaanyiidi muuchi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
